{
  "calcpad": {
    "backend": "CalcpadCE",
    "dirty": false,
    "evaluated_source": "'KUE Windkraftgetriebe - Berechnung aller Stufen, CAD nur erste Stufe\r\n'Angabe_KUE_Teil_II_WS2023_2024.pdf, Seiten 6-10\r\n'Variante waehlt Lastdaten und beide Aufbauarten gemeinsam\r\nVariante = 1\r\n#if Variante ≡ 1\r\nP_Rotor = 1000kW\r\nn_Rotor = 22/min\r\nn_Generator_Ziel = 1000/min\r\neta_1 = 0.995\r\neta_2 = 0.99\r\neta_SS = 0.975\r\ni_SS = 0.34\r\nmode_1 = 1\r\nmode_2 = 1\r\n#end if\r\n#if Variante ≡ 2\r\nP_Rotor = 500kW\r\nn_Rotor = 30/min\r\nn_Generator_Ziel = 1200/min\r\neta_1 = 0.995\r\neta_2 = 0.99\r\neta_SS = 0.97\r\ni_SS = 0.35\r\nmode_1 = 1\r\nmode_2 = 2\r\n#end if\r\n#if Variante ≡ 3\r\nP_Rotor = 300kW\r\nn_Rotor = 40/min\r\nn_Generator_Ziel = 1500/min\r\neta_1 = 0.99\r\neta_2 = 0.98\r\neta_SS = 0.965\r\ni_SS = 0.36\r\nmode_1 = 2\r\nmode_2 = 1\r\n#end if\r\n#if Variante ≡ 4\r\nP_Rotor = 100kW\r\nn_Rotor = 60/min\r\nn_Generator_Ziel = 1800/min\r\neta_1 = 0.99\r\neta_2 = 0.98\r\neta_SS = 0.96\r\ni_SS = 0.38\r\nmode_1 = 2\r\nmode_2 = 2\r\n#end if\r\n'T_in direkt fuer eigene Drehmomentlastfaelle ersetzbar\r\nK_A = 1.1\r\nn_in = n_Rotor\r\nT_in = K_A*P_Rotor/(2*pi*n_in)\r\nR_Ziel = 3.4\r\nz_s = 30\r\nz_s2 = 30\r\nn_Planeten = 3\r\nalpha_grad = 20\r\nbreitenfaktor = 15\r\n'Vorauslegung, kein ISO-6336-Festigkeitsnachweis; konservative Lastaufteilung\r\nsigma_F_zul = 160N/mm^2\r\nY_F = 0.30\r\nK_gamma = 1.25\r\nsigma_Bolzen_zul = 200N/mm^2\r\ntau_Welle_zul = 60N/mm^2\r\nE_Stahl = 210000N/mm^2\r\ndelta_Bolzen_zul = 0.04mm\r\ntheta_Bolzen_zul = 0.005\r\n'Verzahnung: ungeaendertes Bezugsprofil, gerade Zaehne; ganzzahlige Montagebedingung\r\noffset_1 = 3-mode_1\r\noffset_2 = 3-mode_2\r\nz_p = 3*round(z_s*(R_Ziel-offset_1)/6)\r\nz_r = z_s+2*z_p\r\nR_1 = offset_1+2*z_p/z_s\r\n#if abs(R_1-round(R_1)) < 0.000001\r\nz_p = z_p-3\r\nz_r = z_s+2*z_p\r\nR_1 = offset_1+2*z_p/z_s\r\n#end if\r\nR_2_Ziel = n_Generator_Ziel/n_in*i_SS/R_1\r\nz_p2 = 3*round(z_s2*(R_2_Ziel-offset_2)/6)\r\nz_r2 = z_s2+2*z_p2\r\nR_2 = offset_2+2*z_p2/z_s2\r\n#if abs(R_2-round(R_2)) < 0.000001\r\n#if R_2_Ziel > R_2\r\nz_p2 = z_p2+3\r\n#else\r\nz_p2 = z_p2-3\r\n#end if\r\nz_r2 = z_s2+2*z_p2\r\nR_2 = offset_2+2*z_p2/z_s2\r\n#end if\r\ni_1 = 1/R_1\r\ni_2 = 1/R_2\r\ni_gesamt = i_1*i_2*i_SS\r\nn_1 = n_in*R_1\r\nn_2 = n_1*R_2\r\nn_Generator = n_2/i_SS\r\nDrehzahlabweichung = n_Generator/n_Generator_Ziel-1\r\nP_Eingang = T_in*2*pi*n_in\r\nP_1 = P_Eingang*eta_1\r\nP_2 = P_1*eta_2\r\nP_Generator = P_2*eta_SS\r\nT_1 = T_in*eta_1/R_1\r\nT_2 = T_1*eta_2/R_2\r\nT_Generator = T_2*eta_SS*i_SS\r\n'Einfaches Zahnfussmodell Ft/(b*m*Y_F); keine Hertz-/Ermuedungsfreigabe\r\nT_Sonne_Auslegung = T_in/R_1\r\nmodul_min = (2*K_gamma*T_Sonne_Auslegung/(n_Planeten*z_s*breitenfaktor*Y_F*sigma_F_zul))^(1/3)\r\n'Bevorzugte Modulliste; manuelle Wahl bleibt moeglich\r\nmodul_auto = 200mm\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 100mm\r\nmodul_auto = 100mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 80mm\r\nmodul_auto = 80mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 63mm\r\nmodul_auto = 63mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 50mm\r\nmodul_auto = 50mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 40mm\r\nmodul_auto = 40mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 32mm\r\nmodul_auto = 32mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 25mm\r\nmodul_auto = 25mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 20mm\r\nmodul_auto = 20mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 16mm\r\nmodul_auto = 16mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 12mm\r\nmodul_auto = 12mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 10mm\r\nmodul_auto = 10mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 8mm\r\nmodul_auto = 8mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 6mm\r\nmodul_auto = 6mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 5mm\r\nmodul_auto = 5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 4mm\r\nmodul_auto = 4mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 3mm\r\nmodul_auto = 3mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 2.5mm\r\nmodul_auto = 2.5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 2mm\r\nmodul_auto = 2mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 1.5mm\r\nmodul_auto = 1.5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 1.25mm\r\nmodul_auto = 1.25mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 1mm\r\nmodul_auto = 1mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 0.8mm\r\nmodul_auto = 0.8mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 0.6mm\r\nmodul_auto = 0.6mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul_min ≤ 0.5mm\r\nmodul_auto = 0.5mm\r\n#end if\r\nmodul = modul_auto\r\nmodul2_min = (2*K_gamma*(T_1/R_2)/(n_Planeten*z_s2*breitenfaktor*Y_F*sigma_F_zul))^(1/3)\r\n'Bevorzugte Modulliste; manuelle Wahl bleibt moeglich\r\nmodul2_auto = 200mm\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 100mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 100mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 80mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 80mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 63mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 63mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 50mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 50mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 40mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 40mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 32mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 32mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 25mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 25mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 20mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 20mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 16mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 16mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 12mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 12mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 10mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 10mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 8mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 8mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 6mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 6mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 5mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 4mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 4mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 3mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 3mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 2.5mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 2.5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 2mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 2mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 1.5mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 1.5mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 1.25mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 1.25mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 1mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 1mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 0.8mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 0.8mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 0.6mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 0.6mm\r\n#end if\r\n#if modul2_min ≤ 0.5mm\r\nmodul2_auto = 0.5mm\r\n#end if\r\nmodul2 = modul2_auto\r\nb = breitenfaktor*modul\r\na = modul*(z_s+z_p)/2\r\nd_s = modul*z_s\r\nd_p = modul*z_p\r\nd_r = modul*z_r\r\nF_t = 2*T_Sonne_Auslegung/(n_Planeten*d_s)\r\nsigma_F = K_gamma*F_t/(b*modul*Y_F)\r\nF_Bolzen = 2*K_gamma*F_t\r\nSpiel_axial = 0.2*modul\r\nPlatte = 2*modul\r\nBolzenspanne = b+2*Spiel_axial+Platte\r\nd_Bolzen_Biegung = (8*F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne/(pi*sigma_Bolzen_zul))^(1/3)\r\nd_Bolzen_Durchbiegung = (4*F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne^3/(3*pi*E_Stahl*delta_Bolzen_zul))^(1/4)\r\nd_Bolzen_Neigung = (4*F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne^2/(pi*E_Stahl*theta_Bolzen_zul))^(1/4)\r\npin_r = ceiling(max(d_Bolzen_Biegung;d_Bolzen_Durchbiegung;d_Bolzen_Neigung)/2/mm)*mm\r\nbore_p = pin_r+modul\r\nWand_Planet = modul*(z_p/2-1.25)-bore_p\r\nbore_s = ceiling((16*T_Sonne_Auslegung/(pi*tau_Welle_zul))^(1/3)/2/mm)*mm\r\nhub_r = ceiling((16*T_in/(pi*tau_Welle_zul))^(1/3)/2/mm)*mm+modul\r\nring_outer = modul*(z_r/2+6)\r\nZahnflankenspiel = 0.02*modul\r\nNachbarabstand = sqrt(3)*a-modul*(z_p+2)\r\nI_Bolzen = pi*(2*pin_r)^4/64\r\ndelta_Bolzen = F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne^3/(48*E_Stahl*I_Bolzen)\r\ntheta_Bolzen = F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne^2/(16*E_Stahl*I_Bolzen)\r\nsigma_Bolzen = 8*F_Bolzen*Bolzenspanne/(pi*(2*pin_r)^3)\r\n'Alle Eingaben und Ergebnisse bleiben im CAD-Projekt; CAD erst bewusst aktualisieren\r\n\r\nS_Zahn = sigma_F_zul/sigma_F\r\nS_Bolzen = sigma_Bolzen_zul/sigma_Bolzen\r\nS_Durchbiegung = delta_Bolzen_zul/delta_Bolzen\r\nS_Neigung = theta_Bolzen_zul/theta_Bolzen\r\nWandreserve = Wand_Planet/modul\r\nMontageindex = (z_s+z_r)/n_Planeten\r\nn_eingang_rpm = n_in*min\r\nT_eingang_Nm = T_in/(N*m)\r\n",
    "html": "<p id=\"line-1\" data-source-line=\"1\" class=\"line\">KUE Windkraftgetriebe - Berechnung aller Stufen, CAD nur erste Stufe </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-2\" data-source-line=\"2\" class=\"line\">Angabe_KUE_Teil_II_WS2023_2024.pdf, Seiten 6-10 </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-3\" data-source-line=\"3\" class=\"line\">Variante waehlt Lastdaten und beide Aufbauarten gemeinsam </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-4\" data-source-line=\"4\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Variante</var> = 1</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-6\" data-source-line=\"6\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>P</var><sub>Rotor</sub> = 1000 <i>kW</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-7\" data-source-line=\"7\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>Rotor</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">22<span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>min</i></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-8\" data-source-line=\"8\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>Generator_Ziel</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">1000<span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>min</i></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-9\" data-source-line=\"9\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>eta</var><sub>1</sub> = 0.995</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-10\" data-source-line=\"10\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>eta</var><sub>2</sub> = 0.99</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-11\" data-source-line=\"11\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>eta</var><sub>SS</sub> = 0.975</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-12\" data-source-line=\"12\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>i</var><sub>SS</sub> = 0.34</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-13\" data-source-line=\"13\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>mode</var><sub>1</sub> = 1</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-14\" data-source-line=\"14\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>mode</var><sub>2</sub> = 1</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-49\" data-source-line=\"49\" class=\"line\">T_in direkt fuer eigene Drehmomentlastfaelle ersetzbar </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-50\" data-source-line=\"50\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>K</var><sub>A</sub> = 1.1</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-51\" data-source-line=\"51\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>in</sub> = <var>n</var><sub>Rotor</sub> = 22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-52\" data-source-line=\"52\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>in</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>K</var><sub>A</sub> · <var>P</var><sub>Rotor</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2 · <var>pi</var> · <var>n</var><sub>in</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">1.1 · 1000 <i>kW</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2 · 3.14 · 22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span> = 477.46 <i>kNm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-53\" data-source-line=\"53\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>R</var><sub>Ziel</sub> = 3.4</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-54\" data-source-line=\"54\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>s</sub> = 30</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-55\" data-source-line=\"55\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>s2</sub> = 30</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-56\" data-source-line=\"56\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>Planeten</sub> = 3</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-57\" data-source-line=\"57\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>alpha</var><sub>grad</sub> = 20</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-58\" data-source-line=\"58\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>breitenfaktor</var> = 15</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-59\" data-source-line=\"59\" class=\"line\">Vorauslegung, kein ISO-6336-Festigkeitsnachweis; konservative Lastaufteilung </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-60\" data-source-line=\"60\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>sigma</var><sub>F_zul</sub> = 160 <span class=\"dvc\"><i>N</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-61\" data-source-line=\"61\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Y</var><sub>F</sub> = 0.3</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-62\" data-source-line=\"62\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>K</var><sub>gamma</sub> = 1.25</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-63\" data-source-line=\"63\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>sigma</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub> = 200 <span class=\"dvc\"><i>N</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-64\" data-source-line=\"64\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>tau</var><sub>Welle_zul</sub> = 60 <span class=\"dvc\"><i>N</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-65\" data-source-line=\"65\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>E</var><sub>Stahl</sub> = 210000 <span class=\"dvc\"><i>N</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-66\" data-source-line=\"66\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>delta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub> = 0.04 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-67\" data-source-line=\"67\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>theta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub> = 0.005</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-68\" data-source-line=\"68\" class=\"line\">Verzahnung: ungeaendertes Bezugsprofil, gerade Zaehne; ganzzahlige Montagebedingung </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-69\" data-source-line=\"69\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>offset</var><sub>1</sub> = 3 − <var>mode</var><sub>1</sub> = 3 − 1 = 2</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-70\" data-source-line=\"70\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>offset</var><sub>2</sub> = 3 − <var>mode</var><sub>2</sub> = 3 − 1 = 2</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-71\" data-source-line=\"71\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>p</sub> = 3 · <b>round</b><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\"><var>z</var><sub>s</sub> ·  ( <var>R</var><sub>Ziel</sub> − <var>offset</var><sub>1</sub> ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>6</span><span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 3 · <b>round</b><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">30 ·  ( 3.4 − 2 ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>6</span><span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 21</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-72\" data-source-line=\"72\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>r</sub> = <var>z</var><sub>s</sub> + 2 · <var>z</var><sub>p</sub> = 30 + 2 · 21 = 72</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-73\" data-source-line=\"73\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>R</var><sub>1</sub> = <var>offset</var><sub>1</sub> + <span class=\"dvc\">2 · <var>z</var><sub>p</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>z</var><sub>s</sub></span> = 2 + <span class=\"dvc\">2 · 21<span class=\"dvl\"></span>30</span> = 3.4</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-79\" data-source-line=\"79\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>R</var><sub>2_Ziel</sub> = <span class=\"dvc up\"><span class=\"dvc\"><var>n</var><sub>Generator_Ziel</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>in</sub></span> · <var>i</var><sub>SS</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>1</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc up\"><span class=\"dvc\">1000 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span> · 0.34<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.4</span> = 4.55</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-80\" data-source-line=\"80\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>p2</sub> = 3 · <b>round</b><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\"><var>z</var><sub>s2</sub> ·  ( <var>R</var><sub>2_Ziel</sub> − <var>offset</var><sub>2</sub> ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>6</span><span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 3 · <b>round</b><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">30 ·  ( 4.55 − 2 ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>6</span><span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 39</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-81\" data-source-line=\"81\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>z</var><sub>r2</sub> = <var>z</var><sub>s2</sub> + 2 · <var>z</var><sub>p2</sub> = 30 + 2 · 39 = 108</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-82\" data-source-line=\"82\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>R</var><sub>2</sub> = <var>offset</var><sub>2</sub> + <span class=\"dvc\">2 · <var>z</var><sub>p2</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>z</var><sub>s2</sub></span> = 2 + <span class=\"dvc\">2 · 39<span class=\"dvl\"></span>30</span> = 4.6</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-92\" data-source-line=\"92\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>i</var><sub>1</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>1</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.4</span> = 0.294</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-93\" data-source-line=\"93\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>i</var><sub>2</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>2</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4.6</span> = 0.217</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-94\" data-source-line=\"94\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>i</var><sub>gesamt</sub> = <var>i</var><sub>1</sub> · <var>i</var><sub>2</sub> · <var>i</var><sub>SS</sub> = 0.294 · 0.217 · 0.34 = 0.0217</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-95\" data-source-line=\"95\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>1</sub> = <var>n</var><sub>in</sub> · <var>R</var><sub>1</sub> = 22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup> · 3.4 = 74.8 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-96\" data-source-line=\"96\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>2</sub> = <var>n</var><sub>1</sub> · <var>R</var><sub>2</sub> = 74.8 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup> · 4.6 = 344.08 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-97\" data-source-line=\"97\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>Generator</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>n</var><sub>2</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>i</var><sub>SS</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">344.08 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>0.34</span> = 1012 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-98\" data-source-line=\"98\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Drehzahlabweichung</var> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>n</var><sub>Generator</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>Generator_Ziel</sub></span> − 1 = <span class=\"dvc\">1012 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>1000 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup></span> − 1 = 0.012</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-99\" data-source-line=\"99\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>P</var><sub>Eingang</sub> = <var>T</var><sub>in</sub> · 2 · <var>pi</var> · <var>n</var><sub>in</sub> = 477.46 <i>kNm</i> · 2 · 3.14 · 22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup> = 1100 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-100\" data-source-line=\"100\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>P</var><sub>1</sub> = <var>P</var><sub>Eingang</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>1</sub> = 1100 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup> · 0.995 = 1094.5 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-101\" data-source-line=\"101\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>P</var><sub>2</sub> = <var>P</var><sub>1</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>2</sub> = 1094.5 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup> · 0.99 = 1083.56 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-102\" data-source-line=\"102\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>P</var><sub>Generator</sub> = <var>P</var><sub>2</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>SS</sub> = 1083.56 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup> · 0.975 = 1056.47 <i>t</i><i> · </i><i>m</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>s</i><sup class=\"unit\">3</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-103\" data-source-line=\"103\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>1</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>T</var><sub>in</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>1</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>1</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">477.46 <i>kNm</i> · 0.995<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.4</span> = 139.73 <i>kNm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-104\" data-source-line=\"104\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>2</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>T</var><sub>1</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>2</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>2</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">139.73 <i>kNm</i> · 0.99<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4.6</span> = 30.07 <i>kNm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-105\" data-source-line=\"105\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>Generator</sub> = <var>T</var><sub>2</sub> · <var>eta</var><sub>SS</sub> · <var>i</var><sub>SS</sub> = 30.07 <i>kNm</i> · 0.975 · 0.34 = 9.97 <i>kNm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-106\" data-source-line=\"106\" class=\"line\">Einfaches Zahnfussmodell Ft/(b*m*Y_F); keine Hertz-/Ermuedungsfreigabe </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-107\" data-source-line=\"107\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>Sonne_Auslegung</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>T</var><sub>in</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>1</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">477.46 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.4</span> = 140.43 <i>kNm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-108\" data-source-line=\"108\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>min</sub> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">2 · <var>K</var><sub>gamma</sub> · <var>T</var><sub>Sonne_Auslegung</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>Planeten</sub> · <var>z</var><sub>s</sub> · <var>breitenfaktor</var> · <var>Y</var><sub>F</sub> · <var>sigma</var><sub>F_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">2 · 1.25 · 140.43 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3 · 30 · 15 · 0.3 · 160 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = 0.0176 <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-109\" data-source-line=\"109\" class=\"line\">Bevorzugte Modulliste; manuelle Wahl bleibt moeglich </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-110\" data-source-line=\"110\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 200 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-112\" data-source-line=\"112\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 100 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-115\" data-source-line=\"115\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 80 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-118\" data-source-line=\"118\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 63 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-121\" data-source-line=\"121\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 50 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-124\" data-source-line=\"124\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 40 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-127\" data-source-line=\"127\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 32 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-130\" data-source-line=\"130\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 25 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-133\" data-source-line=\"133\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-183\" data-source-line=\"183\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul</var> = <var>modul</var><sub>auto</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-184\" data-source-line=\"184\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>min</sub> = <span class=\"b2\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc up\">2 · <var>K</var><sub>gamma</sub> · <span class=\"dvc\"><var>T</var><sub>1</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>R</var><sub>2</sub></span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>Planeten</sub> · <var>z</var><sub>s2</sub> · <var>breitenfaktor</var> · <var>Y</var><sub>F</sub> · <var>sigma</var><sub>F_zul</sub></span></span><span class=\"b2\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = <span class=\"b2\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc up\">2 · 1.25 · <span class=\"dvc\">139.73 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>4.6</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3 · 30 · 15 · 0.3 · 160 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span></span><span class=\"b2\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = 0.0105 <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-185\" data-source-line=\"185\" class=\"line\">Bevorzugte Modulliste; manuelle Wahl bleibt moeglich </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-186\" data-source-line=\"186\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 200 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-188\" data-source-line=\"188\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 100 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-191\" data-source-line=\"191\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 80 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-194\" data-source-line=\"194\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 63 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-197\" data-source-line=\"197\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 50 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-200\" data-source-line=\"200\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 40 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-203\" data-source-line=\"203\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 32 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-206\" data-source-line=\"206\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 25 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-209\" data-source-line=\"209\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-212\" data-source-line=\"212\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 16 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-215\" data-source-line=\"215\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 12 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-259\" data-source-line=\"259\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>modul2</var> = <var>modul2</var><sub>auto</sub> = 12 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-260\" data-source-line=\"260\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>b</var> = <var>breitenfaktor</var> · <var>modul</var> = 15 · 20 <i>mm</i> = 300 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-261\" data-source-line=\"261\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>a</var> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>modul</var> ·  ( <var>z</var><sub>s</sub> + <var>z</var><sub>p</sub> ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> = <span class=\"dvc\">20 <i>mm</i> ·  ( 30 + 21 ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> = 510 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-262\" data-source-line=\"262\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>s</sub> = <var>modul</var> · <var>z</var><sub>s</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i> · 30 = 600 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-263\" data-source-line=\"263\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>p</sub> = <var>modul</var> · <var>z</var><sub>p</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i> · 21 = 420 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-264\" data-source-line=\"264\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>r</sub> = <var>modul</var> · <var>z</var><sub>r</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i> · 72 = 1440 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-265\" data-source-line=\"265\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>F</var><sub>t</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">2 · <var>T</var><sub>Sonne_Auslegung</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>Planeten</sub> · <var>d</var><sub>s</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">2 · 140.43 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3 · 600 <i>mm</i></span> = 156.03 <i>kN</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-266\" data-source-line=\"266\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>sigma</var><sub>F</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>K</var><sub>gamma</sub> · <var>F</var><sub>t</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>b</var> · <var>modul</var> · <var>Y</var><sub>F</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">1.25 · 156.03 <i>kN</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>300 <i>mm</i> · 20 <i>mm</i> · 0.3</span> = 108357 <i>kPa</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-267\" data-source-line=\"267\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = 2 · <var>K</var><sub>gamma</sub> · <var>F</var><sub>t</sub> = 2 · 1.25 · 156.03 <i>kN</i> = 390.09 <i>kN</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-268\" data-source-line=\"268\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Spiel</var><sub>axial</sub> = 0.2 · <var>modul</var> = 0.2 · 20 <i>mm</i> = 4 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-269\" data-source-line=\"269\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Platte</var> = 2 · <var>modul</var> = 2 · 20 <i>mm</i> = 40 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-270\" data-source-line=\"270\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Bolzenspanne</var> = <var>b</var> + 2 · <var>Spiel</var><sub>axial</sub> + <var>Platte</var> = 300 <i>mm</i> + 2 · 4 <i>mm</i> + 40 <i>mm</i> = 348 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-271\" data-source-line=\"271\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Biegung</sub> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">8 · <var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>pi</var> · <var>sigma</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">8 · 390.09 <i>kN</i> · 348 <i>mm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.14 · 200 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup> = 0.12 <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-272\" data-source-line=\"272\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Durchbiegung</sub> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">4 · <var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><sup>3</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3 · <var>pi</var> · <var>E</var><sub>Stahl</sub> · <var>delta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4</span></sup> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">4 · 390.09 <i>kN</i> ·  ( 348 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>3</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3 · 3.14 · 210000 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup> · 0.04 <i>mm</i></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4</span></sup> = 0.17 <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-273\" data-source-line=\"273\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Neigung</sub> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">4 · <var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><sup>2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>pi</var> · <var>E</var><sub>Stahl</sub> · <var>theta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4</span></sup> = <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">4 · 390.09 <i>kN</i> ·  ( 348 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.14 · 210000 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup> · 0.005</span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>4</span></sup> = 0.087 <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-274\" data-source-line=\"274\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>pin</var><sub>r</sub> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b2\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc up\"><span class=\"dvc\"><b>max</b> ( <var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Biegung</sub>; <var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Durchbiegung</sub>; <var>d</var><sub>Bolzen_Neigung</sub> ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b2\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b2\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc up\"><span class=\"dvc\"><b>max</b> ( 0.12 <i>m</i>; 0.17 <i>m</i>; 0.087 <i>m</i> ) <span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b2\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> = 85 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-275\" data-source-line=\"275\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>bore</var><sub>p</sub> = <var>pin</var><sub>r</sub> + <var>modul</var> = 85 <i>mm</i> + 20 <i>mm</i> = 105 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-276\" data-source-line=\"276\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Wand</var><sub>Planet</sub> = <var>modul</var> · <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\"><var>z</var><sub>p</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> − 1.25<span class=\"b1\">)</span> − <var>bore</var><sub>p</sub> = 20 <i>mm</i> · <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">21<span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> − 1.25<span class=\"b1\">)</span> − 105 <i>mm</i> = 80 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-277\" data-source-line=\"277\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>bore</var><sub>s</sub> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b3\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">16 · <var>T</var><sub>Sonne_Auslegung</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>pi</var> · <var>tau</var><sub>Welle_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b3\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b3\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">16 · 140.43 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.14 · 60 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b3\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> = 115 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-278\" data-source-line=\"278\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>hub</var><sub>r</sub> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b3\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">16 · <var>T</var><sub>in</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>pi</var> · <var>tau</var><sub>Welle_zul</sub></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b3\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> + <var>modul</var> = <b>ceiling</b><span class=\"b3\">(</span><span class=\"dvc down\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"dvc\"><span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">16 · 477.46 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.14 · 60 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup></span><span class=\"b1\">)</span><sup class=\"raised\"><span class=\"dvc\">1<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span></sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>mm</i></span></span><span class=\"b3\">)</span> · <i>mm</i> + 20 <i>mm</i> = 192 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-279\" data-source-line=\"279\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>ring</var><sub>outer</sub> = <var>modul</var> · <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\"><var>z</var><sub>r</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> + 6<span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 20 <i>mm</i> · <span class=\"b1\">(</span><span class=\"dvc\">72<span class=\"dvl\"></span>2</span> + 6<span class=\"b1\">)</span> = 840 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-280\" data-source-line=\"280\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Zahnflankenspiel</var> = 0.02 · <var>modul</var> = 0.02 · 20 <i>mm</i> = 0.4 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-281\" data-source-line=\"281\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Nachbarabstand</var> = &ensp;&hairsp;&hairsp;<span class=\"o0\"><span class=\"r\">√</span>&hairsp;3</span> · <var>a</var> − <var>modul</var> ·  ( <var>z</var><sub>p</sub> + 2 )  = &ensp;&hairsp;&hairsp;<span class=\"o0\"><span class=\"r\">√</span>&hairsp;3</span> · 510 <i>mm</i> − 20 <i>mm</i> ·  ( 21 + 2 )  = 423.35 <i>mm</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-282\" data-source-line=\"282\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>I</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>pi</var> ·  ( 2 · <var>pin</var><sub>r</sub> ) <sup>4</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>64</span> = <span class=\"dvc\">3.14 ·  ( 2 · 85 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>4</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>64</span> = 40998275 <i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">4</sup></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-283\" data-source-line=\"283\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>delta</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><sup>3</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>48 · <var>E</var><sub>Stahl</sub> · <var>I</var><sub>Bolzen</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">390.09 <i>kN</i> ·  ( 348 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>3</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>48 · 210000 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup> · 40998275 <i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">4</sup></span> = 3.98×10<sup>-5</sup> <i>m</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-284\" data-source-line=\"284\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>theta</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><sup>2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>16 · <var>E</var><sub>Stahl</sub> · <var>I</var><sub>Bolzen</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">390.09 <i>kN</i> ·  ( 348 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>16 · 210000 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup> · 40998275 <i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">4</sup></span> = 0.000343</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-285\" data-source-line=\"285\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>sigma</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\">8 · <var>F</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> · <var>Bolzenspanne</var><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>pi</var> ·  ( 2 · <var>pin</var><sub>r</sub> ) <sup>3</sup></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">8 · 390.09 <i>kN</i> · 348 <i>mm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.14 ·  ( 2 · 85 <i>mm</i> ) <sup>3</sup></span> = 70361.1 <i>kPa</i></span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-286\" data-source-line=\"286\" class=\"line\">Alle Eingaben und Ergebnisse bleiben im CAD-Projekt; CAD erst bewusst aktualisieren </p>\r\n<p id=\"line-287\" data-source-line=\"287\" class=\"line\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p id=\"line-288\" data-source-line=\"288\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>S</var><sub>Zahn</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>sigma</var><sub>F_zul</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>sigma</var><sub>F</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">160 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>108357 <i>kPa</i></span> = 1.48</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-289\" data-source-line=\"289\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>S</var><sub>Bolzen</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>sigma</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>sigma</var><sub>Bolzen</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">200 <i>N</i><i class=\"unit\"> ∕ </i><i>mm</i><sup class=\"unit\">2</sup><span class=\"dvl\"></span>70361.1 <i>kPa</i></span> = 2.84</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-290\" data-source-line=\"290\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>S</var><sub>Durchbiegung</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>delta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>delta</var><sub>Bolzen</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">0.04 <i>mm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>3.98×10<sup>-5</sup> <i>m</i></span> = 1.01</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-291\" data-source-line=\"291\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>S</var><sub>Neigung</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>theta</var><sub>Bolzen_zul</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>theta</var><sub>Bolzen</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">0.005<span class=\"dvl\"></span>0.000343</span> = 14.58</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-292\" data-source-line=\"292\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Wandreserve</var> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>Wand</var><sub>Planet</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>modul</var></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">80 <i>mm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span>20 <i>mm</i></span> = 4</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-293\" data-source-line=\"293\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>Montageindex</var> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>z</var><sub>s</sub> + <var>z</var><sub>r</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><var>n</var><sub>Planeten</sub></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">30 + 72<span class=\"dvl\"></span>3</span> = 34</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-294\" data-source-line=\"294\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>n</var><sub>eingang_rpm</sub> = <var>n</var><sub>in</sub> · <i>min</i> = 22 <i>min</i><sup class=\"unit\">-1</sup> · <i>min</i> = 22</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-295\" data-source-line=\"295\" class=\"line\"><span class=\"eq\"><var>T</var><sub>eingang_Nm</sub> = <span class=\"dvc\"><var>T</var><sub>in</sub><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>N</i><i> · </i><i>m</i></span> = <span class=\"dvc\">477.46 <i>kNm</i><span class=\"dvl\"></span><i>N</i><i> · </i><i>m</i></span> = 477465</span></p>\r\n<p id=\"line-296\" data-source-line=\"296\" class=\"line\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
